===Etymology===
{{PIE root|de|ped}}
From {{affix|de|Fuß|t1=foot|Ball|t2=ball}}, a {{calque|de|en|football|nocap=1}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈfuːsˌbal/|lang=de}}
* {{audio|De-Fußball.ogg|audio|lang=de}}

===Noun===
{{de-noun|m|Fußballs|gen2=Fußballes|Fußbälle}}

# the sport of [[association football]]; [[soccer]]
# the ball with which association football is played: a [[football]], a [[soccer ball]]

